@startuml
'==== Title ====
title US007 - "As an Administrator, I want to register a new country in the system" - SSD

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false

skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ArrowColor #57595BAA

hidefootbox
autonumber
autoactivate off

' ==== Actor and participants ====
actor Administrator as Adm
participant "MiteLovers" as UI1

'==== Processes ====
Adm -> UI1: I want to register a country
activate UI1
UI1 --> Adm: What is the country name?
deactivate UI1

Adm -> UI1: Country Name
activate UI1

UI1 --> Adm : Country registered successfully!
deactivate UI1
@enduml